The vocabulary data in this directory (lexicon.tsv, excluded.tsv) is derived
from ELELex, part of the CEFRLex project (CENTAL, Université catholique de
Louvain): https://cental.uclouvain.be/cefrlex/elelex/

ELELex is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-
ShareAlike 4.0 International License, and so is this derived data:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Changes from ELELex: lemmas filtered to content words, assigned a single CEFR
level from per-level document counts, merged with this project's curated
curriculum and a hand-picked A0 set, and given English glosses and
parts of speech written for this project.

The A0 list (a0.txt) and the rest of this repository's code are under the MIT
licence in the repository root.
